  // 1.5 M19 drops (Expedition: fish, coins, potions; Infinity: fish and potions; none in Adventure
  // chapter 1 or the free battle): a defeated slime leaves one with "chance" ("eliteChance" for an
  // elite), of a kind drawn by "weights"; a boss leaves "bossDrops" coins. A click picks it up; it
  // fades after "life" s (the last "fade" s fading), at most "maxOnFloor" at once. Fish: "fishHeal" HP;
