  // Expedition (docs/EXPEDITION-DIRECTION.md, PetExpedition.cs): one run over "steps" (node kinds
  // per step, in lane order: "fight" or "elite"; the boss comes after the last). A new run draws an
  // encounter for each node from "fights"/"elites" (never the same twice in one step) and keeps
  // that map. The cat's HP and build go on from step to step; "winHeal" (share of max HP) comes back
  // after a won step. "stepThreat": enemies get that much stronger per step. Leaving a step's battle
  // (End, leaving Battle Mode, closing the app) keeps the run: the step waits to be fought again,
  // for "retreatCost" of the max HP (0 since 2026-10-23: leaving costs nothing). Encounters are
  // clear stages (same keys as Adventure stages, no reward or tip); their ids are stable (a saved
  // run names them) and never an Adventure stage's. "unlockAfter": the Adventure stage to win first.
  // "kindGacha" (instead of "steps", 2026-10-22): the map shows only the boss at first; each of the
  // "steps" steps gets "minLanes"–"maxLanes" nodes drawn by "weights" when the run reaches it (the
  // map's Spin), kept from then on; "rerollCost": spinning a drawn step again (once a step, before
  // going to a node) costs that share of the max HP. Always: step 1 has no elite or rest, a step at most one rest and
  // never only elites, the step before the boss a rest. "capsules": after each won fight node, a free
  // capsule ("freeCard" of the time a common card, else "freeHeal" of the max HP) or a gold one for
  // "goldCost" of the max HP (by weight: "relic", "rare" card, "cardHeal" a card + "goldHeal" HP).
  // Infinity ("endless", 2026-10-22): one battle that is never won. Wave n has "firstCount" +
  // "countPerWave" × (n − 1) enemies (at most "maxCount"), drawn from "kinds" (each from its
  // "from" wave on, by "weight"), and threat 1 + "threatPerWave" × (n − 1). Every "bossEvery"-th wave
  // is the "boss" alone (from "lateBossFrom" with "lateBoss" beside it); after every "upgradeEvery"-th
  // cleared wave the user picks a card (a boss wave gives a second one with "bossBonusPick"). From wave
  // "allSynergiesAt" every synergy is on. The elite chance grows by "eliteChancePerWave" a wave (at most
  // "eliteChanceMax") and every "moreElitesEvery" waves one more elite may be alive (at most "moreElitesMax"). It ends
  // when the cat falls or the user presses End; the record is the furthest wave per weapon and
  // difficulty. "unlockAfter": the Adventure stage to win first. "rulesVersion" keeps old records apart.
  // 1.5 M24 (rules 6): "bosses" take turns on the boss waves; "eras" add newer kinds to the draw, the
  // first from wave "erasFrom", the next after each boss wave, round again after the last (each with the
